# Compiled source #
###################
Programs/Bytecode/*
Programs/Schedules/*
Programs/Public-Input/*
Programs/Functions
*.com
*.class
*.dll
*.exe
*.x
*.o
*.so
# Exception: vendored, version-pinned Boost shared libraries. These are
# committed build artifacts loaded at runtime via the rpath baked in by
# CONFIG.mine ($ORIGIN/pinned-boost), so a system Boost soname bump does
# not break the prebuilt MP-SPDZ binaries.
!pinned-boost/*.so
!pinned-boost/*.so.*
*.pyc
*.bc
*.sch
*.a
*.static
*.d
local/
*.map
*.gch

